 The best ever!

272
00:20:38,042 --> 00:20:40,742
 Hello, hello to the new me!

273
00:20:40,742 --> 00:20:43,542
 It doesn't matter what they say,

274
00:20:43,542 --> 00:20:46,242
 I'll be more and more excited!

275
00:20:46,242 --> 00:20:48,742
 I'm the strongest of the clouds!

276
00:20:48,742 --> 00:20:51,442
 Hello, hello to the infinite
possibilities!

277
00:20:51,442 --> 00:20:54,442
 Challenge everything you want to do!

278
00:20:54,442 --> 00:21:04,218
 I'll prove my exciting future!

279
00:21:04,218 --> 00:21:11,218
 I tried to reach out my hands to you

280
00:21:11,218 --> 00:21:15,218
 I tried my best, but

281
00:21:15,218 --> 00:21:18,218
 I'm sure I can't reach you

282
00:21:18,218 --> 00:21:24,218
 I love you, I miss you

283
00:21:24,218 --> 00:21:27,218
 Every time I think of you like this

284
00:21:27,218 --> 00:21:30,218
 The back of my heart is tight

285
00:21:30,218 --> 00:21:34,218
 A rainbow-colored bench

286
00:21:34,218 --> 00:21:38,218
 I'm waiting for now

287
00:21:38,218 --> 00:21:40,218
 A white bench

288
00:21:40,218 --> 00:21:42,218
 A scene that started to twist

289
00:21:42,218 --> 00:21:44,218
 A vivid memory

290
00:21:44,218 --> 00:21:50,218
 I'm waiting for someone

291
00:22:00,976 --> 00:22:06,976
 You're not coming back here anymore,
are you?

292
00:22:09,976 --> 00:22:12,976
 I was able to say, I'll do my best,
I'll do my best

293
00:22:12,976 --> 00:22:15,976
 Stay by my side a little longer

294
00:22:15,976 --> 00:22:20,976
 I love you, I love you

295
00:22:20,976 --> 00:22:23,976
 Hey, I'll never forget

296
00:22:23,976 --> 00:22:26,976
 Under the sky with one eye open

297
00:22:26,976 --> 00:22:31,976
 I love you, I love you

298
00:22:32,976 --> 00:22:35,976
 Just being like this makes me happy

299
00:22:35,976 --> 00:22:38,976
 This kind of time is happiness

300
00:22:38,976 --> 00:22:42,976
 A rainbow-colored bench

301
00:22:42,976 --> 00:22:46,976
 Will never change

302
00:22:58,330 --> 00:23:09,030
 Benji! One, two, three, four, five!
